/VERSN TABLE FORMAT
/
/11 WORD ENTRIES
/
/ WORDS 1-4  	FILE NAME AND EXTENSION  [ 0=END OF TABLE]
/ WORD  5	STARTING BLOCK OF THE FILE
/ WORD  6   --  TYPE AND FIELD [TTF0]
/		TT = TYPE OF VERSION #
/		F = FIELD OF VERSION #
/	TT=0 -- IGNORE THIS ENTRY
/	TT=1 -- STRIPPED ASCII, ONE WORD, XXYY
/	TT=2 -- RIGHTMOST 6 BITS IN PACKED ASCII
/	TT=3 -- LEFTMOST  6 BITS IN PACKED ASCII
/	TT=4 -- RIGHTMOST 8 BITS IN ASCII
/	TT=5 -- OCTAL TO DECIMAL
/	TT=6 -- 2 CHARS IN PAL, CREF SYMTAB FORMAT
/	TT=7 -- 2 CHARS IN BASIC EDITOR FORMAT
/	TT=10 - LEFT 6BIT IS OCTAL, RIGHT 6BIT IS ASCII
